| WU-0015.3 | Manifest entry `unpromoted` with seed id CONF-1, commit, configuration, environment; outputs stored under `runs/confirmatory/run-1/` and committed because the manifest lists them | human owner | WU-0015.2 | CSQ2 | LPC.PC.15, LPC.AI.8 | none | S |
| WU-0015.4 | Owner releases the outputs to agents | human owner | WU-0015.3 | CSQ2 | LPC.AI.5 ("confirmatory data") | none | S |
